<title>DENMARK: Sophus Berendsen 96 H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Sophus Berendsen 96 H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		 640.2  vs 566.5</p>
<p> Group net turnover		    3,308 vs 2,991</p>
<p> Net result after minorities	 445.4 vs 386.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish holding company is Sophus Berendsen A/S. Its main asset is a 35.7 percent stake in U.K.-based pest control and environmental services firm Rentokil Initial Plc. It reiterated in a statement that it expected continuing progress for whole year 1996. The result was slightly above analyst expectations. --+45-33-969650</p>
</text>
